Package: seqcompendium
Title: The Compendium Engine for the seq- Pipeline Family
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: person("Macaulay", "Winter", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "108404294+MacaulayWinter@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Takes a samples x features table, the study metadata and the
    user's column guide; profiles the data's shape; fits pre-declared default
    methods; and writes CSV results, figures that only read those CSVs, a
    plain-language report and a ranked leads table in which negative results
    are always shown. Roles and types of metadata columns come only from the
    column guide; doubt stops the run. Milestone E1: the walking skeleton.
